 waiting for you to discover~</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876950/extras/e7acbf9d7c8d7795ab9a266e1d3883c5.poster.avif?t=1729842014\" width=600 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876950/extras/e7acbf9d7c8d7795ab9a266e1d3883c5.webm?t=1729842014\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876950/extras/e7acbf9d7c8d7795ab9a266e1d3883c5.mp4?t=1729842014\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Capture cute spirit beasts and fight side by side! Don't waste your powerful spirit beast skills~</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876950/extras/2a450b44b54e29eea129455806861e85.poster.avif?t=1729842014\" width=600 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876950/extras/2a450b44b54e29eea129455806861e85.webm?t=1729842014\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876950/extras/2a450b44b54e29eea129455806861e85.mp4?t=1729842014\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Don't forget to upgrade the spirit beast</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876950/extras/9c8da299ba6a2bc6546d2c6b246c8a3c.poster.avif?t=1729842014\" width=600 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876950/extras/9c8da299ba6a2bc6546d2c6b246c8a3c.webm?t=1729842014\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876950